  "goodToKnow": "Rassistisch means racist: rassistische Äußerungen, ein rassistischer Angriff. Der Rassismus is racism, and der Rassist (a weak noun) is a racist. Because of Germany's history, racism and antisemitism are closely watched topics, and incitement to hatred is a crime (Volksverhetzung). Since 2020 there's been debate about replacing the word Rasse in Article 3 of the Grundgesetz, which says no one may be discriminated against because of it, since the concept of human races is scientifically rejected."
